    {
      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Louisiana?",
      "a": "Louisiana received $131M in federal contract obligations in FY2027 to date. The state recorded 1,082 awards at an average award size of $121K. Historical annual totals show $3.7B in FY22, $4.5B in FY23, $3.9B in FY24, $5B in FY25, and $5.9B in FY26."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies award the most contracts in Louisiana?",
